<title>MEXICO: New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</title>
<headline>New Mexico to Mexico cattle export update -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly update of New Mexico</p>
<p>cattle exports to Mexico, to June 28 - USDA. (Livestock per</p>
<p>head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     490	    14,640     1,445</p>
<p>    Calves			    0		   1	   0</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		 276	 458</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0	     1,427	   0</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    74	     5,203	 664</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
</text>
